Source: secubox-waf
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Gerald KERMA <devel@cybermind.fr>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/CyberMind-FR/secubox-deb

Package: secubox-waf
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, secubox-core (>= 1.0.0), lxc, jq, curl
Recommends: crowdsec, secubox-crowdsec, secubox-haproxy
Description: SecuBox Web Application Firewall (mitmproxy LXC)
 LXC-contained mitmproxy WAF for HTTP/HTTPS traffic inspection.
 All HAProxy traffic routes through mitmproxy for deep inspection.
 .
 Features:
  - LXC container isolation (mitmproxy in 10.100.0.60)
  - Host-based routing via haproxy-routes.json
  - X-SecuBox-WAF header tagging for inspected traffic
  - 300+ threat detection rules across 14+ categories
  - SQL injection, XSS, RCE, LFI detection
  - wafctl control script (status/install/start/stop/routes)
  - CrowdSec integration for centralized banning
  - HAProxy reverse proxy integration
